 * Description: Records explicit per-campaign opt-in and opt-out decisions for recipients of an external email list, creating the WordPress user only when someone explicitly acts.
 * Version: 3
 * Requires at least: 6.5
 * Requires PHP: 7.4
 * Author: JohnDee
